SUMMARY:Open House
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**You’re invited
  to the ECKANKAR Center of Santa Rosa’s Open House**\n**where you can:**
 \n\n* Check out what the Eckankar Center of Santa Rosa has to offer.\n* En
 joy complimentary Bagels and Schmears from our Bagel Bar. (Regular Bagels 
 from Noah's Bagels\; Gluten free Bagels from Mama Mel's)\n* Select a Hot o
 r Cold Beverage from our Coffee and Tea Bar\n* Watch light-hearted talks a
 nd inspiring musical performances live-streamed from our Dual-state ECK Li
 ght and Sound service.\n* Do a fun hands-on creative art activity featured
  from the ***Raise Your Spiritual IQ Spiritual Exercises Guidebook***.\n* 
 Register for the Easy Way Class to start on October 12\, 2026.\n\n**You ca
 n also:**\n\n* Pick out a free introductory ECK book\nfrom a wide range of
  spiritual topics.\n* Borrow and Eckankar Book from our lending library.\n
 * Sign up to receive our free e-newsletter that features local events and 
 classes.\n* Fill out a spiritual activity request form where you can reque
 st in-person specialty workshops such as Dreams and Past Lives Recall.\n* 
 Share community with like-hearted Souls.\n\nFeatured Spiritual Exercise Ha
 nds-on Activity — **Doorway to a Higher Awareness**\nCreate a spiritual 
 vision board of your spiritual goals from an assortment of craft materials
 .\n\nOpen House Itinerary of Activities\n10:00 am to 2:00 pm\nBagel Bar an
 d Coffee Tea Bar Open\nDoorway to a Higher Awareness Creativity Station Op
 en\n11:00 – 12:00\nLive Stream of the California and Nevada ECK Light an
 d Sound Service
