SUMMARY:Open Your Heart to Gain Wisdom and Truth—A Sound of Soul Event
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Would you like t
 o have a meaningful life?**\n**Would you like to be your true self?**\n**D
 o you know that you have all the truth within you?**\n\nYou are warmly inv
 ited to experience HU\, the Sound of Soul. Explore this uplifting love son
 g to God and how it can benefit you in bringing more divine love into your
  daily life.\n\n“So when you ask the Creator\, ‘Show me truth\,’ be 
 ready to receive it. You have to ask with a true and open heart.\n\n“Beh
 ind everything you do is the life pulse of the Holy Spirit\, the Voice of 
 God. The Voice of God speaks to us as the Light and Sound. This is what fi
 lls one with divine love.\n\n“Sing the word *HU*\, a love song to God\, 
 and you will be opened up to divine love. Love will lead you to truth.”\
 n\n—Harold Klemp\, *The Sound of Soul*\, p. 17\n\n**This is a public eve
 nt for those who would like to experience the uplifting Sound of Soul and 
 its benefits.**\nIt includes:\n\n* Heart-opening spiritual content\n* A 15
 -minute HU chant\, followed by quiet contemplation\n* Relaxed spiritual co
 nversation and sharing insights\n* Time for questions and answers\n\n**Cha
 nting HU can give you:**\n\n* Comfort\, peace\, and calm\n* Connection wit
 h divine love\n* Expanded awareness\n* Relief from fear\n* Inner guidance\
 n\n**Family and friends are always welcome!**\n\nLearn more about how to d
 evelop a powerful spiritual exercise that can transform your daily life **
 [HERE](https://eckankarblog.org/hu-app/)**\nTo hear thousands of people si
 nging HU and to sing along\, download the free HU app **[HERE](https://www
 .eckankar.org/experience/hu-the-sound-of-soul/)**
