SUMMARY:Understanding Your Dream Dictionary & Symbols Online Workshop
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Raise Your Spiri
 tual IQ!**\n\n**Are your dreams a mystery? Not understandable?**\n\n**Woul
 d you like spiritual tools to change that?**\n\n**Are you ready to awaken 
 to your full spiritual potential through your dreams?**\n\nCome to this FR
 EE online workshop on dreams!\n\n"As Soul\, you have the God knowledge wit
 hin you."\n—Harold Klemp\, *Raise Your Spiritual IQ!\,* inside cover\n\n
 This workshop explores different ways to understand your own dream languag
 e\, and with these spiritual tools\, can help you live your life in a grea
 ter\, more fulfilling way.\n\n***What to expect. . . .***\n• Expand your
  inner awareness with dream tools\n• Share your experiences with other l
 ike-hearted people!\n• Learn ways to handle challenges from a spiritual 
 perspective\n• Discover techniques to access your divine intuition\n• 
 Get simple spiritual exercises to directly connect with the Life Source\n\
 nDownload the free pdf *Raise Your Spiritual IQ! Experience Journal* to ju
 mpstart your spiritual adventure! **[HERE](https://www.eckankar.org/wp-con
 tent/uploads/2024/10/IQ_Experience-Journal.pdf)**\nAll faiths welcome!\n\n
 Register here on Meetup! We’d love to see you!\n\n\\*\\*\\*Raise Your Sp
 iritual IQ! Understanding Your Dream Dictionary & Symbols Online Workshop 
 \\*\\*\\*is sponsored by ECKANKAR\, The Path of Spiritual Freedom\, and of
 fers spiritual tools and techniques to help with everyday life experiences
 .
