SUMMARY:Spiritual Purpose of Reincarnation in the Family—Spiritual Paren
 ting Chat
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Would you like t
 o hear and share spiritually uplifting stories**\n**of reincarnation in th
 e family?**\n\n**Have you had an experience of recognizing a family member
  that has reincarnated?**\n\n**Did your child connect with you as Soul bef
 ore their birth?**\n\nHas your child had dreams of awakening speaking in o
 ther languages\nand acting out memories of other lifetimes?\n**You are war
 mly invited to come share your stories!**\n\n“As a reminder\, everyone i
 n a family has gathered in this lifetime to take advantage of the best pos
 sible circumstances for each to excel spiritually.\n\n“In the end\, our 
 children will walk their own paths\, in their own shoes.”\n—Harold Kle
 mp\, *A Modern Prophet Answers*\n*Your Key Questions about Life*\, Book 3\
 , p. 77\n\n***Explore. . .***\n\n* The spiritual purpose of reincarnation 
 in the family\n* What part karma plays in our family connections\n* The gi
 fts and talents you've seen in your family that might be from another life
 time\n* Spiritual tools to recall and resolve past lives\n\n“Why remembe
 r past lives?\n\n“We need to understand that the challenges we face toda
 y involve all sorts of past-life experiences. Once we gain awareness of th
 ese links to past lives\, it’s possible to handle our challenges in a be
 tter way this time around. We can end a chain of karma that has hung on fo
 r centuries.\n\n“All debts must be repaid before one gains spiritual fre
 edom.”\n—Harold Klemp\, *ECKANKAR\, Key to Past Lives*\, p. 53\n\n**Ar
 e you looking for ways to bring more spirituality**\n**into your life and 
 the life of your family?**\n\n* We will be sharing experiences of being a 
 parent and acknowledging and recognizing our own inner knowing.\n* It is e
 xciting to share stories and experiences with like-minded parents. By shar
 ing\, our own inner wisdom can be strengthened and validated.\n* Parent di
 scussions offer family-friendly tools in a relaxed setting for exploring s
 piritual truths and how we live them.\n\nYou're warmly invited to share sp
 iritual insights\, stories\, and experiences\, ask questions\, or simply l
 isten.\n\n**Parents\, grandparents\, and friends are always welcome.**\n\n
 Click **[HERE](http://www.eckankar.org/explore/parents-families/)** to lea
 rn about spiritual opportunities for parents and families:\n\nClick **[HER
 E](https://www.adventuresineckparenting.org/se-1/)** to read about how fam
 ily classes or “satsangs” can strengthen your family’s spiritual con
 nection.
