SUMMARY:Listening to Your Inner Guidance—A Spiritual Chat for 18-40 yo
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\n**Would you like t
 o make decisions that align with you spiritually?**\n**Are you looking to 
 strengthen your connection with your inner guidance?**\n**Do you want to l
 earn ways to listen inwardly?**\n\n“Listen to God’s Voice. Respond to 
 It spiritually and know that\, despite every appearance to the contrary\, 
 all is well and in its rightful place.”\n— Harold Klemp\, *ECK Wisdom 
 on Inner Guidance*\, p. 37\n\nYou’re warmly invited to this casual and u
 pbeat chat with other young spiritual seekers who want to learn more about
  the ways of the Divine. Come and share your stories or listen to others' 
 stories of how Spirit works uniquely with each of us.\n\n***Explore*** . .
  .\n\n* Ways to listen and increase your spiritual awareness\n* How to att
 une yourself to the guidance from Divine Spirit\n* Your true self as Soul\
 , a spark of God\, and your inherent divine intuition\n* Learn about a Spi
 ritual Exercise to deepen your understanding of the spiritual messages you
  receive.\n\nDrop in when it works for you and cameras are always optional
 .\nLooking forward to meeting you!\n\n**Welcome to Eckankar**\nThe teachin
 gs of ECKANKAR are based on God’s love and spiritual freedom for everyon
 e.\n\nThey offer you individual spiritual tools\, whatever your path or re
 ligion may be\, to bring you more understanding\, love\, and help in these
  challenging times.\n\nCome\, stay as long as you like\, and explore spiri
 tual resources that can help you\, at your own pace. Feel free to come and
  to go as you wish.\nThere is no pressure\, expectation\, judgment\, or un
 asked-for follow up.\n**We respect your divinity as a spiritual being.**\n
 \n**We honor your choices and your journey.**
