SUMMARY:Experience\, Grow\, Discover!
DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Spiritual Experiences Group\nA golden opportuni
 ty to raise your spiritual awareness awaits you at the **2026 ECK Worldwid
 e Soul Adventure Seminar**\, Secrets of Spiritual Healing: *A Secret to Sp
 iritual Living*\, **October 23–25**.\n\nExplore what spiritual healing m
 eans for you personally. Along the way\, discover the profound reality of 
 divine love in your life. You may never be the same!\n\nExperience heart-o
 pening talks and musical performances\, dynamic workshops\, and in-depth r
 oundtable discussions.\n\n**Did you know that Soul exists because of God
 ’s love for It?**\nExplore what that means in your everyday life.\n\n**T
 he highlight of the seminar is Saturday evening’s talk by Sri Doug Kunin
 \, the spiritual leader of Eckankar**. Inspiring\, engaging\, and warmly r
 elatable\, he speaks directly to you as Soul\, awakening the divine knowle
 dge that is already within you.\n**An awesome journey awaits you!**\nNew t
 o Eckankar? Be our guest with complimentary registration.\n*Register today
  at* **[ECKseminars.org](https://www.eckankar.org/engage/eck-soul-adventur
 e-seminars/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=SemExp-button&utm_campaign=PreReg-
 Online&utm_term=july2026)*[.](https://www.eckankar.org/engage/eck-soul-adv
 enture-seminars/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=SemExp-button&utm_campaign=Pr
 eReg-Online&utm_term=july2026)***\n[#ECKANKAR](https://www.facebook.com/ha
 shtag/eckankar?__eep__=6&__cft__%5b0%5d=AZVy_Sb6ggncoeYZMVMn8EeXgbo5jliJJY
